/ Stage 10e (decisions 148, 274): a value computed on each read is read fresh, and a copy of it holds the moment
/ it was taken — %Now% - %start% measures time only if %start% stays still.
Start
- set %start% = %Now%
- sleep 20 ms
- assert %Now% is greater than %start%, "two reads of Now differ"
- set %held% = %start%
- sleep 20 ms
- assert %start% equals %held%, "a copy of Now holds still"
